ange of direct-sourced and own-brand kitchenware which provides customers with significant value for money."]},{"type":"p","children":["The brand sells directly through its website, www.procook.co.uk, and through 80 own-brand retail stores, located across the UK."]},{"type":"p","children":["Founded over 25 years ago as a family business, selling cookware sets by direct mail in the UK, ProCook has grown into a market leading, multi-channel specialist kitchenware company, employing over 600 colleagues, and operating from its Store Support Centre in Gloucester."]},{"type":"p","children":["As a B Corp, a Real Living Wage employer and a certified Great Place to WorkTM, ProCook is committed to being a socially responsible and environmentally conscious business for the benefit of all stakeholders."]},{"type":"p","children":["ProCook has been listed on the London Stock Exchange since November 2021 (PROC.L)."]},"This information is provided by RNS, the news service of the London Stock Exchange. RNS is approved by the Financial Conduct Authority to act as a Primary Information Provider in the United Kingdom. Terms and conditions relating to the use and distribution of this information may apply. For further information, please contact rns@lseg.com or visit www.rns.com.",{"type":"p","children":["RNS may use your IP address to confirm compliance with the terms and conditions, to analyse how you engage with the information contained in this communication, and to share such analysis on an anonymised basis with others as part of our commercial services. For further information about how RNS and the London Stock Exchange use the personal data you provide us, please see our Privacy Policy.   END  DSHPPUMCBUPQGCC"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"London Stock Exchange","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"lse"}]},{"title":"Management","args":[{"id":"section","value":"management"}]},{"title":"UK stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"GB"}]}